# openstargazer language file -- English (reference)
#
# Format:  key = value        Everything after the first "=" is the text.
#          # ...              Comment line.
#          {name}             Placeholder, filled in at runtime. Keep the
#                             spelling exactly as it appears here.
#
# To add a language: copy this file to <code>.lang (e.g. fr.lang), translate
# the values on the right of the "=", and select it with OSG_LANG=fr or by
# setting your system locale. Keys that are missing in a translation fall
# back to this file, so a partial translation is fine.
#
# Log messages are intentionally not listed here -- they stay English so bug
# reports stay readable.

